{"unit_id":"tag:0F70:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的开浸入（open immersion）。对任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0002>，它在<MATH_0003>上，伴随（adjunction）映射（mappings）<MATH_0004>及<MATH_0005>均为同构（isomorphisms）。事实上，<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>上唯一的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0008>上的限制（restriction）是<MATH_0009>，且它在<MATH_0010>的几何点（geometric points）处的茎（stalks）为零。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F70:proof","translation":"我们鼓励读者逐一展开定义，证明第一个陈述；但这里仅利用它是非常一般的景上的模（Modules on Sites）引理<REF_0001>的特例。对第二个陈述，注意若<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），其在<MATH_0003>上的限制（restriction）为<MATH_0004>，则由伴随性（adjointness）得到映射（map）<MATH_0005>。此映射（map）在<MATH_0006>的几何点（geometric points）的茎（stalks）处为同构（isomorphism），这是由命题<REF_0002>得到的。因此，若<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>的几何点（geometric points）处的茎（stalks）消失，则<MATH_0009>由定理<REF_0003>为同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
